<title>ISRAEL: Nice underwriters exercise option.</title>
<headline>Nice underwriters exercise option.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The underwriters of Nice Systems Ltd's public share offering last week have decided to exercise an option to purchase an additional 397,500 American depositary shares (ADS), Nice said on Sunday.</p>
<p>This will bring the net amount raised by Nice in its offering to $97 million.</p>
<p>Last week the Israeli company issued 2.65 million ADS at $34-1/2 per share.</p>
<p>Nice, a maker of computer telephony integration products, is traded on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange as well as on Nasdaq. Its ADS closed up 1/4 on Friday at $37.</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
